        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Yale YELT-BWK, Yale Expressions Brunswick Lever with Transitional Ellington Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Brunswick Lever with Ellington Rose is available as a dummy function, passage lever, privacy bathroom lever, and as a keyed leverset. This Transitional Door Lever will fit most pre-drilled doors. It is available in only the most popular finish colors for this year! The Yale Expressions Brunswick Lever with Transitional Ellington Rosette is your leverset for any home remodel project.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Brunswick Door Lever with Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Transitional Brunswick Leverset with Ellington Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 2-5/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handing: non-handed</li>\r\n<li>Keyed Entry has a Schlage C keyway.</li> \r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/YAL-YELT-BWK-specifications.pdf?v=1704262433\"><b>Yale YELT-BWK Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. \r\nLever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face). Package Includes: \r\n2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch \r\noperates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, \r\nstrike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. \r\nLatch operates from either side. Turnbutton on interior lever engages privacy lock \r\non both levers; emergency release hole is on exterior lever. Package Includes: \r\n2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n\r\n<li><b>Keyed:</b> Guarded latchbolt operated from outside by key; inside by lever. \r\nTurnbutton on the interior locks outside lever. Outside lever unlocks by key. \r\nComplete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, 2 keys, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Brunswick Lever with Ellington Rose",
                "description": "The Brunswick Lever with Ellington Rose is available as a dummy function, passage lever, privacy bathroom lever, and as a keyed leverset. This Transitional Door Lever will fit most pre-drilled doors. It is available in only the most popular finish colors for this year! The Yale Expressions Brunswick Lever with Transitional Ellington Rosette is your leverset for any home remodel project.",
